  "details": "the invert look axis setting does not appear to function on Android. this would commonly be desirable when users play using popular mobile gamepads like gamesir, backbone, razer and 8bitdo offer, on top of the growing market of android gaming handhelds.\n\nin addition, the ability to rebind inputs in any meaningful way seems absent.\n\ni'd also like to be able to bind some gamepad buttons to common keyboard inputs like E and Q. many game worlds utilize these keys when VR controllers aren't being used.",
